---
import PrivacyLayout from "../../components/PrivacyLayout.astro";
---

<PrivacyLayout
    title="Privacy Policy - PplRate"
    appName="PplRate"
    lastUpdated="31 agosto 2025"
    accentColor="#3498db"
>
    <div class="my-5 rounded-md border-l-4 border-emerald-500/80 bg-emerald-50/70 dark:bg-emerald-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200">
        <strong>In summary:</strong> PplRate is a simple rating and review app that
        operates primarily offline. We collect minimal data and display advertising
        through Google AdMob, which may collect data according to their policies.
    </div>

    <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
    <p>
        PplRate is a mobile application designed to help users rate and review
        various items, places, or experiences. The app is developed with privacy
        in mind and stores most data locally on your device.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Data we do NOT collect ourselves</h2>
    <p>PplRate does not directly collect, transmit, share, or sell:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Personal ratings and reviews data</li>
        <li>Rating history or preferences</li>
        <li>Personally identifiable information</li>
        <li>Location data from ratings</li>
        <li>Device contacts or files</li>
        <li>Biometric data or authentication information</li>
        <li>App usage patterns or behavior</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Advertising and Google AdMob</h2>
    <p>To support app development, we use Google AdMob which may collect:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Advertising identifiers (Advertising ID)</li>
        <li>Device information (model, OS version)</li>
        <li>App usage data for advertising purposes</li>
        <li>Network and connection information</li>
        <li>Approximate location data (for geo-targeted ads)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        This data is handled directly by Google according to their
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" class="text-[var(--accent-color)] underline underline-offset-2 decoration-2 hover:opacity-80"
            >Privacy Policy</a
        >
        and
        <a
            href="https://support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543"
            target="_blank" class="text-[var(--accent-color)] underline underline-offset-2 decoration-2 hover:opacity-80">AdMob Policies</a
        >.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Local data storage</h2>
    <p>All your rating and review data is stored locally on your device:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Ratings and reviews you create</li>
        <li>Categories and tags you use</li>
        <li>Personal notes and comments</li>
        <li>App preferences and settings</li>
        <li>Custom rating criteria</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        This data never leaves your device and is not synchronized with external
        servers or cloud services.
    </p>

    <h2>5. App permissions</h2>
    <p>PplRate requests minimal permissions:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>Internet access:</strong> Required to display advertisements
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Network state:</strong> To check connectivity for ad loading
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Local storage:</strong> To save your ratings and app preferences
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Camera (optional):</strong> To add photos to your reviews (photos
            are stored locally only)
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        We do not request access to microphone, contacts, precise location, or
        other sensitive device features.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Data security</h2>
    <p>Your data is protected through:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>Local storage only:</strong> All rating data remains on your
            device
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>App sandboxing:</strong> Data is isolated within the app's secure
            container
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>No cloud sync:</strong> No automatic uploading or synchronization
            of personal data
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Limited network activity:</strong> Only advertising data is transmitted
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Photo and media handling</h2>
    <p>If you choose to add photos to your reviews:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Photos are stored locally on your device only</li>
        <li>Images are not uploaded to external servers</li>
        <li>Photo metadata (EXIF data) may be stripped for privacy</li>
        <li>You can delete photos at any time within the app</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>8. Backup and export</h2>
    <p>
        PplRate may offer export functionality to help you backup your ratings:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Export files are generated locally on your device</li>
        <li>You control where and how to store exported data</li>
        <li>Exports may include ratings, reviews, and photos</li>
        <li>No automatic cloud backup is performed</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. Third-party services</h2>
    <p>PplRate integrates only:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>Google AdMob:</strong> For advertising (subject to Google policies)
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        We do not use analytics services, crash reporting, social media
        integrations, or other third-party tracking services.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
        PplRate can be used by people of all ages for rating and reviewing
        items. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children
        under 13. The app's offline nature and local storage make it appropriate
        for family use.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Advertising controls</h2>
    <p>You can control ad personalization:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>Android:</strong> Settings > Google > Ads > Opt out of Ads Personalization
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>iOS:</strong> Settings > Privacy & Security > Apple Advertising
            > Personalized Ads
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>12. Data retention and deletion</h2>
    <p>Since all data is stored locally, you control retention by:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Deleting individual ratings or reviews within the app</li>
        <li>Clearing all app data through device settings</li>
        <li>Uninstalling the app (removes all local data)</li>
        <li>Using app reset functionality if available</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Advertising data retention is governed by Google AdMob policies.</p>

    <h2>13. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>Updates to this privacy policy will be communicated through:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>App store updates</li>
        <li>In-app notifications (if implemented)</li>
        <li>Updated privacy policy publication</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>14. Regulatory compliance</h2>
    <p>PplRate is designed to comply with:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation)</strong>
        </li>
        <li><strong>CCPA (California Consumer Privacy Act)</strong></li>
        <li>
            <strong>COPPA (Children's Online Privacy Protection Act)</strong>
        </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="my-5 rounded-md border-l-4 border-emerald-500/80 bg-emerald-50/70 dark:bg-emerald-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200">
        <strong>Remember:</strong> Your ratings, reviews, and photos never leave
        your device. Only advertising data is handled by Google AdMob according to
        their policies.
    </div>

    <div slot="additional-contact">
        <p>
            For advertising-related matters, contact
            <a
                href="https://support.google.com/ads/contact/abg_afc"
                target="_blank" class="text-[var(--accent-color)] underline underline-offset-2 decoration-2 hover:opacity-80">Google AdMob Support</a
            > directly.
        </p>
    </div>
</PrivacyLayout>
